{"summary":"A puzzle game where you collect balls of the same color to complete a tube!","description":"Play the Ball Sort Quiz game to train your brain and challenge higher levels!\n\n[How to Play]\n- Lightly touch a tube to move the ball to another tube.\n- You can only move balls when the topmost ball is the same color.\n- You can move the ball only if there is enough space in the tube.\n- You can move any colored ball into an empty tube.\n- The level is completed when all tubes are filled with balls of the same color.\n- You can find '?' by moving the top ball.\n- You can restart the stage at any time if you get stuck.\n\n[Features]\n- Control is possible with one finger.\n- No time limit, play anytime, anywhere.\n- Easy for anyone to enjoy.\n- Freely change balls, caps, and backgrounds.\n- Use items for easier success!\n- Compete with other users and increase your ranking for additional rewards.\n- Supports red-green colorblind mode.\n\nHelp : cs@mobirix.com\n\nHomepage :\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=4864673505117639552","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $99.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Kt8tG0atWQY?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CRl3bxoa6UpSD6km896af4eNxzHU0JH0pcNleDFNTs1OMDj_ZRg8G-lLsbqD8FB2OYIy3t6UAg3pgl3fYwan7XQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7zJBAnM7UmoAmxm72tWe6PMZm9IC4tvGgLUW0FY7l9WGZWg95gdbhjJftT0nyTVPtQqeysr83Z1stUnW0pBacQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JxCpByK4dIMkAGxWTsqT3CHabkkWTMwcO9n7_W4IACe1HulUsgXPoFUF5zH6hXzFwQjHaeW0pgs8kFfOhWKaYw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3f1z5sJzm0B6SKv3zQKsJtS--x4ajuHk1aoIrGPCNsRDUOt0QJEuCnTkGkUkXqKXTJzamXjsi4I7tZbcNX3FaXA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vYCbLAdzu3IRpUaidBKeu1VW4T20soIo5EJeuyeox0qOM_XIZfVpwdt5LblwQbQ-cL0E4nccU41uBpX71CoYog","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cJ3KOBLsMPuideNapz-Dh2zrRMobr2WDi9xcit1ZI6K_x10yt1GFnpGd7Zx2QcWSqzYtCev-N2qEM839obf